Topology splitter-demo: 3 nodes, 1 links, 2 capture branches
  client -> client; interfaces: eno7=eno7
  server -> server; interfaces: eno7=eno7
  sniffer -> sniffer; interfaces: eno7=eno7, eno8=eno8
Management (mgmt0 via eno1np0):
  client: 52:54:00:87:00:02
  server: 52:54:00:87:00:03
  sniffer: 52:54:00:87:00:04
client: SSH client (172.16.135.2)
server: SSH server (172.16.135.3)
sniffer: SSH sniffer (172.16.135.4)
Data interfaces are unnumbered. Exit removes containers and their files.
